`E″` of the fiber is `2`-isogenous to the pair curve of `(p, q) = (2UV, W²) = (1215696, 1221025)`
(`IsPerfectCuboid.not_onFiber_of_isogeny`), with `D = q² − p² = (U² − V²)² = 12985286209`. The
descent for this pair has 80000 groups `(λ, σ₀)` over 2160 values of `λ`; 79952 of them
